---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
const regions = [['Africa','Current project focus in Abuja, with future coverage across West, East, Southern and North Africa.','Initial market'],['Europe','Accepting conversations for selected opportunities across the UK and European markets.','Future coverage'],['Middle East','A long-term focus on the UAE, Saudi Arabia, Qatar and neighbouring markets.','Future coverage'],['North America','Selected future development and partnership opportunities in the USA and Canada.','Future coverage'],['Asia-Pacific','Selective international opportunities across established Asian and Pacific markets.','Future coverage'],['South America','Longer-term development and partnership opportunities as the company grows.','Future coverage']];
---
<BaseLayout title="Global Presence — TH Homes" description="TH Homes' current market, international enquiry coverage and future regional growth."><section class="page-hero"><div class="page-hero-inner"><h1>Global thinking, grounded growth.</h1><p>We are building an international company region by region—beginning with Abuja, working through credible partnerships and expanding only where our delivery capability supports it.</p></div></section><section class="section"><div class="section-inner split-page"><div class="page-copy" data-reveal><h2>Presence means more than a pin on a map.</h2><p>Our map distinguishes where TH Homes is focused today from the markets we are preparing to serve. As operational offices, active projects and partnerships are established, this page will document them clearly.</p><a class="text-link" href="/consultation">International project enquiry <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></div><div class="map-shell" data-reveal><img src="/Images/globe.jpeg" alt="World map showing TH Homes' international outlook" width="1200" height="540" /><div class="map-legend"><span class="legend-item"><i class="legend-dot solid"></i> Initial market</span><span class="legend-item"><i class="legend-dot"></i> Future coverage</span></div></div></div></section><section class="section" style="padding-top:0"><div class="section-inner"><div class="section-head" data-reveal><h2>Regional outlook</h2><p>International enquiries are welcome. Project acceptance depends on location, scope, partners and delivery readiness.</p></div><div class="region-list" data-reveal>{regions.map(([title, copy, status]) => <article class="region"><h3>{title}</h3><p>{copy}</p><span class="region-status">{status}</span></article>)}</div></div></section><section class="cta-band" data-reveal><h2>Planning across borders?</h2><a class="button" href="/consultation">Start the conversation</a></section></BaseLayout>
